The inspiration, algorithmic reference and model pipeline originate from:
Indra OCR by Datalab and its contributors
https://github.com/datalab-to/indra

Detection postprocessing, recognition preprocessing, CTC/language-model decoding
and layout algorithms have been adapted and reimplemented in Rust from the
Apache-2.0 Indra source. This is an independent port, not an official Datalab release.

Indra model weights and language-model data are separate assets under the
modified OpenRAIL-M license in Resources/Models/LICENSE (or the packaged bundle).
Reimplementation does not change that license.

